From 9a1b931e40d0d621f41caa65e6d4714291466994 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ahow <13916301+ahow@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:12:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(stop-rule): durable-first cancel with bounded
 purge/snapshot; mark stop-rule snapshot cancelled/partial

- runStopRuleCancelSequence: flag sync, PG cancel + Redis/local notify committed
  promptly and concurrently with a time-bounded queue purge; snapshot only by the
  path that transitioned the batch, bounded, never gating the cancel
- cancelBatchRun returns whether it transitioned (idempotent no-op => false)
- stop-rule snapshot rows rejected as 'cancelled/partial ... not comprehensive'
- tests: never-resolving purge/snapshot fakes; real local-PG stop-rule + race test
- integration: identify every descendant; allowlist only tsx's esbuild --service
  helper by exe+cmdline; zero-descendant checks unchanged (+ after-stop check)
